# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings and binary safety
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git auto-detects these as binary today, and gets it right. It is pinned
# anyway: if a .mat ever went through CRLF conversion the model would be
# silently corrupted, and a corrupted grader is not something a test would
# obviously catch. Not worth leaving to detection.
*.mat  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary

# Text: normalised to LF in the repository, checked out native.
*.m    text
*.py   text
*.js   text
*.mjs  text
*.json text
*.html text
*.css  text
*.md   text

# Windows batch files need CRLF to run correctly.
*.bat  text eol=crlf
